      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raleigh%2C_North_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s post office opened on October 1, 1910, with Charles C. as its first postmaster.",
